      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The old key cannot be found by publishing only the new key.\nFor mixed Parquet batches, preserve compatible types and nullable non-key fields.\nInsert marker 0 does not deduplicate replays; immutable ordered publication still matters.",
